[Mission.Objectives]
Dispute the enemy advance in the direction of Dubrova - Syrtsev.
[Mission.Description]
In conjunction with antitank artillery battery and antitank rifle platoon hold the area of the defense firmly. A special priority should be given to holding the positions on the right flank and in Syrtsev. 
[Mission.Success]
Mission complete, enemy attacks have been repelled.
[Mission.Failed]
The enemy disrupted the defensive line, our troops are retreating.
[Submission_1.Objectives]
Prevent the enemy from destroying the air defense battery positioned in the village. 
[Submission_1.Success]
Attempt to penetrate the right flank of defense is suppressed.
[Submission_1.Failed]
The air defense battery has been destroyed, the enemy advances on the right flank.
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Hold the positions in the vicinity of Syrtsev at any cost.
[Submission_2.Success]
Mission complete, the enemy attacks have been repelled.
[Submission_2.Failed]
Our forces withdraw under strikes of superior enemy.
[Submission_3.Objectives]
Withdraw the troops to the positions in Syrtsev. Prevent the enemy from capturing the village.
[Submission_3.Success]
Mission complete, the enemy attacks have been repelled.
[Submission_3.Failed]
Syrtsev has been occupied by the enemy, our troops withdraw.
